  1534	def holm_bonferroni(pvals: Dict[str, float], alpha: float) -> Dict[str, Dict]:
  1535	    """Holm (1979) step-down correction over a family of one-sided p-values.
  1536	
  1537	    Reported alongside the t-bar rather than instead of it: with the
  1538	    pre-registered t >= 3 the correction is not what binds, but it is the
  1539	    structural place multiplicity is handled, so it lives in the code and not
